<title>USA: LTV Corp names Kelly president and COO.</title>
<headline>LTV Corp names Kelly president and COO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTV Corp on Monday said it appointed Peter Kelly to the newly created position of president and chief operating officer of the company and named him to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Kelly will retain his responsibilities as president and chief operating officer of LTV's largest subsidiary, LTV Steel Co, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The steelmaker's stock traded at 14-7/16 Monday morning, down 1/8.</p>
</text>
